segment.source:
::Yes, that's where we stopped. And don't worry, I'll try to make it as easy to follow as possible.

Well, it was my turn to come up with something this time around, and I really wanted something that was based on music. Not only that, I wanted something that would, if not top, then at least be as interesting as Arthur Asimov's challenge from a few months back. But I was struggling to come up with the right idea, until I remembered that 3 times 12 equals 36...
::&lt;end&gt;

